**types.cpp formats `degrees` and `deg_per_s` stream output.**

## Symbols

- `ostream& operator<<(ostream&, degrees)` → `value + "deg"`.
- `ostream& operator<<(ostream&, deg_per_s)` → `value + "deg/s"`.

## Integration

- `std_include.hpp` supplies `ostream`; `types.hpp` defines `degrees` and `deg_per_s`.
- Namespace: `gamepad::unstable::controller::aim`.